## OPERATING RULE

Before generating any asset, ask one question:

> **Can this visual be reused in at least 5 future LOGs?**

If the answer is no — do not generate it.

The objective is not content. The objective is a **visual universe** — a library that makes every new LOG feel like another transmission from the same world.

